# Apps installed outside Homebrew (App Store or vendor site).
# Format: display name|path[|path...]  (any listed path existing counts as installed)
# Role overlays add more (e.g. role.personal-machine.apps).
Cursor|/Applications/Cursor.app
1Password|/Applications/1Password.app
ChatGPT|/Applications/ChatGPT.app|/Applications/ChatGPT Classic.app
Roam Research|/Applications/Roam Research.app
iTerm|/Applications/iTerm.app
Flycut|/Applications/Flycut.app
Rectangle|/Applications/Rectangle.app
VS Code|/Applications/Visual Studio Code.app
Zoom|/Applications/zoom.us.app
